---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Crown Facilities Management"
  description="Hard FM, soft FM and renovations across London & the Southeast. One team, every trade. 24/7 response. CHAS, SafeContractor, NICEIC."
>
  <!-- ====== HERO ====== -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero__video">
      <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto">
        <source src="/images/shard-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__overlay"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Built<br />around<br /><em>standards.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero__intro">
        Preventative maintenance, reactive support, and planned solutions for
        commercial and residential properties across London and the Southeast.
        One team. Every trade. Zero stress.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__btns">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn--gold">Request A Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:01276582081" class="btn btn--outline-white">
          <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
          01276 582 081
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== BADGE STRIP (sits below the hero) ====== -->
  <section class="badges" aria-label="Why Crown FM">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badges__grid">
        <div class="badge">
          <div class="badge__icon">
            <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span>24/7 Response</span>
        </div>
        <div class="badge">
          <div class="badge__icon">
            <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span>Fully Insured</span>
        </div>
        <div class="badge">
          <div class="badge__icon">
            <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span>Quality Assured</span>
        </div>
        <div class="badge">
          <div class="badge__icon">
            <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span>Experienced</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== WHO WE ARE ====== -->
  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <p class="section-label">Who We Are</p>
          <h2>Two decades<br />in the <em>construction</em> industry.</h2>
          <p>
            Crown Facilities Management was founded on a straightforward
            principle: buildings should work. With over 20 years of hands-on
            experience across the construction and facilities management
            sectors, we understand what it takes to keep commercial and
            residential properties safe, compliant, and performing at their
            best.
          </p>
          <p>
            We are a single-source provider. That means one point of contact,
            one team, every trade. From reactive call-outs to planned
            preventative maintenance, from full-scale renovations to
            day-to-day cleaning and security, Crown delivers a consistent,
            reliable standard across every service line.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our clients trust us because we respond fast, communicate
            clearly, and get it right the first time. No subcontractor
            chains. No finger-pointing. Just a team that turns up, does the
            work, and keeps your building running.
          </p>
          <div class="about__stats">
            <div class="about__stat reveal">
              <div class="about__stat-num">20+</div>
              <span>Years Experience</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about__stat reveal">
              <div class="about__stat-num">Rapid</div>
              <span>Response</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about__stat reveal">
              <div class="about__stat-num">24/7</div>
              <span>Call Out</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about__image reveal">
          <img src="/images/construction.jpeg" alt="Crown FM engineer reviewing site plans" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== SERVICES ====== -->
  <section class="services" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="services__header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">Our Services</p>
        <h2>One team. <em>Every trade.</em></h2>
        <p>
          Complete facilities management under one roof. We cover every
          discipline so you don't have to manage multiple contractors.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="services__grid">
        <!-- SOFT FM -->
        <article class="service-card reveal">
          <div class="service-card__image">
            <img src="/images/soft-fm.jpg" alt="Polished commercial lobby interior" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="service-card__head">
            <div class="service-card__icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Soft FM</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card__body">
            <p>
              The services that keep your building clean, secure, and
              presentable. We handle the day-to-day operations so your team
              can focus on running the business. Every service is delivered
              by our own trained staff — no agency workers, no subcontractor
              lottery.
            </p>
            <ul class="service-card__list">
              <li><strong>Commercial Cleaning</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Window Cleaning</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Washroom Services</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Security Services</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Waste Management</strong></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- HARD FM -->
        <article class="service-card reveal">
          <div class="service-card__image">
            <img src="/images/hard-fm.jpg" alt="Mechanical plant room interior" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="service-card__head">
            <div class="service-card__icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Hard FM</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card__body">
            <p>
              The mechanical, electrical, and structural backbone of your
              property. Whether planned or reactive, we keep your building
              safe, compliant, and fully operational. Our engineers are
              multi-skilled and qualified to work across all core building
              disciplines.
            </p>
            <ul class="service-card__list">
              <li><strong>Reactive Maintenance</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Planned Maintenance</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Mechanical &amp; Electrical</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Fire Safety &amp; Security</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Air Conditioning</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Structural Steel Work</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Rope Access</strong></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- RENOVATIONS -->
        <article class="service-card reveal">
          <div class="service-card__image">
            <img src="/images/renovations.jpg" alt="Refurbished interior with curved archway" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="service-card__head">
            <div class="service-card__icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M12 12h.01"/><path d="M17 12h.01"/><path d="M7 12h.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Renovations</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card__body">
            <p>
              From commercial fit-outs to domestic refurbishments, we manage
              every stage of the project. Design, planning, build, and
              handover — all under one team. No project managers chasing
              subcontractors. Just one company delivering start to finish.
            </p>
            <ul class="service-card__list">
              <li><strong>Commercial Renovations</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Domestic Refurbishments</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Structural Alterations</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Layout Reconfiguration</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Interior Upgrades</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Listed Building Works</strong></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== TAGLINE BANNER ====== -->
  <section class="tagline">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>One team. Every trade.<br /><em>Zero stress.</em></h2>
      <div class="tagline__badges">
        <div class="tagline__badge">
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          Rapid Response
        </div>
        <div class="tagline__badge">
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          Fully Insured
        </div>
        <div class="tagline__badge">
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          Quality Guaranteed
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== CLIENTS ====== -->
  <section class="clients">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Trusted By</p>
      <div class="clients__row">
        <span class="clients__name">Barratt Homes</span>
        <span class="clients__name">Redrow</span>
        <span class="clients__name">Bellway</span>
        <span class="clients__name">Persimmon</span>
        <span class="clients__name">Wates</span>
        <span class="clients__name">Vinci</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== TESTIMONIAL ====== -->
  <section class="testimonial">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="testimonial__card reveal">
        <p class="section-label">Client Feedback</p>
        <p class="testimonial__quote">
          Crown FM have been instrumental in keeping our sites running
          smoothly. Reliable, professional and responsive.
        </p>
        <p class="testimonial__name">Operations Manager</p>
        <p class="testimonial__role">National Housebuilder</p>
        <div class="testimonial__stars">&#9733; &#9733; &#9733; &#9733; &#9733;</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== ACCREDITATIONS ====== -->
  <section class="accreditations">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="accreditations__header">
        <p class="section-label">Accreditations &amp; Memberships</p>
      </div>
      <div class="accreditations__row">
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/chas.jpeg" alt="CHAS" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/safe-contractor.jpeg" alt="SafeContractor" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/constructionline.jpeg" alt="Constructionline" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/niceic.jpeg" alt="NICEIC" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/ipaf.jpeg" alt="IPAF" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/pasma.jpeg" alt="PASMA" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/ciphe.jpeg" alt="CIPHE" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/ssip.jpeg" alt="SSIP" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/acclaim.jpeg" alt="Acclaim" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/safelife.jpeg" alt="Safelife" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="accred"><img src="/images/accreditations/watersafe.jpeg" alt="WaterSafe" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== CONTACT ====== -->
  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="contact__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <p class="section-label">Contact</p>
          <h2>Tell us about<br />your <em>building.</em></h2>
          <p>
            Whether you need a reactive call-out, a planned maintenance
            contract, or a full renovation — get in touch and we'll come
            back to you the same day.
          </p>
          <a href="tel:01276582081" class="contact__phone">01276 582 081</a>
          <a href="mailto:info@crown-fm.co.uk" class="contact__email">info@crown-fm.co.uk</a>
        </div>

        <form
          class="contact__form reveal"
          name="contact"
          method="POST"
          action="/thanks"
          data-netlify="true"
          data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
        >
          <!-- Required so Netlify knows which form this is. -->
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
          <!-- Honeypot: real users leave this blank; bots fill it. Netlify silently drops those submissions. -->
          <p class="bot-field">
            <label>Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
          </p>

          <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="name" />
          <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required autocomplete="email" />
          <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Phone" autocomplete="tel" />
          <textarea name="message" placeholder="How can we help?" required></textarea>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--gold">Send Enquiry</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== FAQ ====== -->
  <section class="faq" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="faq__header">
        <p class="section-label">FAQ</p>
        <h2>Common <em>questions.</em></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq__item open">
        <div class="faq__q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>What does Crown FM cover under facilities management?</span>
          <span class="arrow">&#9660;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__a">
          <div class="faq__a-inner">
            Crown FM provides both Hard FM and Soft FM services. That
            includes everything from electrical testing, HVAC, plumbing, and
            fire safety through to commercial cleaning, security, washroom
            services, and waste management. We also handle planned
            preventative maintenance programmes and emergency reactive
            call-outs to keep your property compliant and fully operational.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>How quickly can you respond to an emergency?</span>
          <span class="arrow">&#9660;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__a">
          <div class="faq__a-inner">
            We operate a rapid response service for emergency call-outs. Our
            24/7 service line handles urgent issues like leaks, electrical
            faults, or security breaches. Our reactive maintenance team
            covers London and the Southeast and is trained to minimise
            downtime and disruption to your operations.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>Do you handle both commercial and domestic renovations?</span>
          <span class="arrow">&#9660;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__a">
          <div class="faq__a-inner">
            Yes. Crown FM manages renovations and refurbishments for both
            commercial and residential properties. From office fit-outs and
            retail space reconfiguration to domestic kitchen and bathroom
            refurbishments, we oversee the full lifecycle: design, planning,
            construction, and handover. Every project is managed in-house
            with no subcontractor chains.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>What types of property do you work with?</span>
          <span class="arrow">&#9660;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__a">
          <div class="faq__a-inner">
            We work across commercial offices, hotels, residential
            developments, retail units, healthcare sites, schools, and
            industrial premises. Whether you manage a single building or a
            multi-site portfolio, Crown FM delivers a consistent, reliable
            standard tailored to your property's needs.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>What makes Crown FM different?</span>
          <span class="arrow">&#9660;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__a">
          <div class="faq__a-inner">
            We are a genuine single-source provider. One team covers every
            trade, so you deal with one company, one point of contact, and
            one standard of work across your entire property. Our leadership
            team brings over 20 years of construction industry experience,
            and we are fully accredited with CHAS, SafeContractor, and
            Constructionline Gold. We don't just maintain buildings. We
            build partnerships.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
